曰仇，仇者讎也。少子曰成師，成師大號，成之者也。名自命也；物自定也。今適庶名反逆，此後晉其能毋亂乎？」","source_term":"生太子仇"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji039-010","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p001694"]},{"id":"gcb_rf3_coi_AA","label":"伯（晉昭侯）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"昭侯伯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m010-0011"]},{"surface":"昭侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0000","c-shiji-039-jin:m012-0011","c-shiji-039-jin:m012-0047"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m010-0011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p010","quote":"昭侯伯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p011","quote":"昭侯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m012-0011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p012","quote":"昭侯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m012-0047","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p012","quote":"昭侯"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p010","quote":"三十五年，文侯仇卒，子昭侯伯立。","source_term":"子昭侯伯"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji039-012","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_A"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p001698"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m010-0011","c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0000","c-shiji-039-jin:m012-0011","c-shiji-039-jin:m012-0047"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:p010","c-shiji-039-jin:p011","c-shiji-039-jin:p012"],"passage_count":3}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["